Maintainer Note / 维护者须知（非许可条款 / NOT license terms）
========================================================================

The sections below are project-internal guidance for maintainers and
contributors who modify or extend this dual-licensed SDK directory. They
are NOT additional license terms for recipients of the SDK. Each source
file in this directory carries a short pointer to this section.

以下内容是面向维护者与贡献者的项目内部开发规范，用于约束对本双许可 SDK
目录的修改与扩展；它们不是对 SDK 使用者的额外许可条款。本目录每个源文件
头部的简短警示均指向本节。

1) Commercial use of this SDK / 本 SDK 的商业使用

   Files in this directory are dual-licensed. Closed-source commercial tools
   (e.g. RemoteProgram tools) that are licensed by the TabulexFlow Team
   may use and bundle this SDK under the TabulexFlow Commercial License;
   the AGPL v3 copyleft does NOT apply to them, and the closed-source tool is
   NOT required to open source its code.

   本目录下的 SDK 文件按双许可发布。经 TabulexFlow Team 商业授权的闭源
   商业工具（如 RemoteProgram 工具）可按 TabulexFlow 商业许可使用并打包
   本 SDK；AGPL v3 传染性条款不对其适用，闭源工具无需因此开源其代码。

2) Dependency red line / 依赖红线

   Files in this directory (and any code that imports them) must NOT import
   copyleft-only open-source libraries that are exclusively licensed under
   GPL/AGPL (e.g. mutagen, PyMuPDF). Importing such libraries would make the
   closed-source commercial license option invalid.

   本目录下的文件（及引入本文件的代码）不得 import 仅以 GPL/AGPL 授权的
   copyleft-only 开源库（如 mutagen、PyMuPDF）；引入此类库将导致闭源商业
   许可选项失效。
